<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Morgan Stanley analyst Josephine Esquivel said she upgraded Nike Inc to a strong buy from an outperform, noting that the sharp drop in Nike shares on Friday was &quot;very much overstated.&quot;</p>
<p>Nike shares were down 4-1/4 to 54-7/8 and had traded as low as 53-1/2 earlier in the session.</p>
</text>
